        "narrow_column": true,
        "divider": false
      }
    },
    "95d041fa-c372-480c-b7bf-dc083802852e": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "template--14952484012092__95d041fa-c372-480c-b7bf-dc083802852e-167388143848264c4b-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": false,
            "text": "<p><strong>Social Media Specialist<\/strong><\/p><p>Call for job description.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "5bad1d5a-1629-4251-b91e-f734e0f791bf": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": false,
            "text": "<p><strong>Designers\/Design Assistants<\/strong><\/p><p>We are currently seeking goal-oriented designers\/sales professionals with prior sales experience.<\/p><p>The ideal candidate for this position loves to help clients with their furniture, art, rug and accessory selections. He or she is fashion forward with a type A personality, exudes enthusiasm and is self-motivated. A professional appearance is required as daily interface with customers is to be expected. Top-quality customer service is part of the culture at Noël Home, so we value exceptional presentation, communication and customer service skills.<\/p><p>The applicant must be able to work 40 hours per week (5 days per week, including some weekends), and scheduling flexibility is a must.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "91651fc3-0eed-4f55-8c03-2a4b0f13763d": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": false,
            "text": "<p><strong>Ready to Apply?<\/strong><\/p><p>If a career in the high-end furniture industry appeals to you and any of these positions sound like the perfect fit, we’d love to see your resume! Please contact us at <a href=\"tel:17138745200\" title=\"tel:17138745200\">713-874-5200<\/a> or email <a href=\"mailto:info@noelhome.com\">info@noelhome.com<\/a> for more information.<\/p>"
          }
        }
      },
